{"id":"8d2092e8-2834-4524-9bd0-bb102114993d","created":1787762610,"model":"sensenova-6.8-flash-lite","object":"chat.completion","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\n\n{\"facts\":[{\"fact\":\"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\"},{\"fact\":\"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠是仓管\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"仓管裴小棠把这批货从“待发”改成“报损”\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠把这批货从“待发”改成“报损”\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"仓管裴小棠把这批货从“待发”改成“报损”\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠通知司机取消下午去港东批发市场的车\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"并通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\"},{\"fact\":\"司机回了一句“知道了”\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"司机回了一句“知道了”\"},{\"fact\":\"司机把已经发动的货车熄了火\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"便把已经发动的货车熄了火\"},{\"fact\":\"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠去拿拖把\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"裴小棠又去拿拖把\"}]}","reasoning":"Let me analyze this chapter carefully and extract all facts.\n\nThe chapter is short. Let me go through it:\n\n1. 冷库的温控器在午前跳闸 - The cold storage temperature controller tripped before noon. Status: 已发生.\n\n2. 整箱荔枝很快开始渗水 - Whole boxes of lychees quickly started leaking water. Status: 已发生.\n\n3. 仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\" - Warehouse manager Pei Xiaotang changed this batch from \"pending shipment\" to \"damaged goods\". Status: 已发生.\n\n4. 并通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车 - And notified the driver to cancel the afternoon trip to Gangdong wholesale market. Status: 已发生 (言语事件).\n\n5. 司机回了一句\"知道了\" - The driver replied \"got it\". Status: 已发生.\n\n6. 便把已经发动的货车熄了火 - Then turned off the already-started truck. Status: 已发生.\n\n7. 渗出水顺着托盘流到地面 - The leaked water flowed along the pallet to the ground. Status: 已发生.\n\n8. 裴小棠又去拿拖把 - Pei Xiaotang went to get a mop. Status: 已发生.\n\nLet me also note:\n- 裴小棠 is 仓管 (warehouse manager) - identity fact.\n- 司机 is a driver - identity.\n- 港东批发市场 is a location.\n- 荔枝 is the cargo.\n\nLet me structure these as facts with proper evidence.\n\nFor fact 4, the notification to cancel - this is a 已发生言语事件. The driver's response \"知道了\" could be seen as acknowledgment but not necessarily a commitment. Let me think... \"知道了\" is just acknowledgment, not a promise. So I'll record the notification as 已发生.\n\nLet me write the JSON.\n"},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1593,"completion_tokens":704,"total_tokens":2297,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}},"request_id":"8d2092e8-2834-4524-9bd0-bb102114993d"}
